								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=744"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10539#msg10539"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10539#msg10539">Re: Conviction</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #18 on:</b> August 27, 2004, 02:55:24 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							And why the hell is conviction a target of the last couple of rants.&nbsp; They raid time on rotation and Ikkinz once or twice a week, neither of which are contested.&nbsp; They haven&#039;t touched a time flagging mob in months.&nbsp; <br /><br />If its this bad now I predict a shitstorm of posts when they start reflagging ALL the pop flag mobs up to time.&nbsp; I suggest you save your &quot;oh nos conviction is da debil, they take down grummus once every six months&quot; posts for later.&nbsp; <br /><br />If your pissed that your guild members are deguilding and applying to conviction I suggest you take it up with your guild leadership.&nbsp; Happy people satisfied with their guild and its progresion don&#039;t deguild.&nbsp; Clean your own fucking house before you go around judging others, Conviction is doing what any other guild does to remain progressive, accepting applications. 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
