								<a href="mailto:Jeff1marshall@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10553#msg10553"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10553#msg10553">Re: Conviction</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #22 on:</b> August 27, 2004, 05:33:47 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							K, dont see where i said anything bad about conviction, i have no problem with them.&nbsp; But uh, think and read what you want, its not my fault you percieve it as such, but it was never my intent.&nbsp; I have many friends in Convction, i know Wan and Fae and Woven in RL, and if you need to know the name of who was sending me tells, ask them, they know, ive talked to them about it.&nbsp; Its not my right to accuse a single person as the whole of a guild.&nbsp; <br />My whole arguement was to let it be known, that this is happening, and some people dont appreciate it, nothing more nothing less.&nbsp; The whole guild is not doing this no, some are, soo i still no gripe against Conviction.&nbsp; <br /><br />bullshit accusations????&nbsp; Then how is that&nbsp; 3 of the 10 people who have posted here, have said that this happened............are we all part of some secret society built to take down Conviction???&nbsp; <br />&nbsp; Again my whole point was not to fire blame or to bad mouth anyone, it was simply to state that this sort of thing is happening.&nbsp; <br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
