							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10556#msg10556"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10556#msg10556">Re: Conviction</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #23 on:</b> August 27, 2004, 05:47:40 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Read your original post again, it was obviously written poorly if you didn&#039;t intend it to be a rant against Conviction..especially in a forum called &quot;rants and raves&quot; and in a post entitled &quot;Conviction&quot;  If you didn&#039;t mean to write anything bad about Conviction, why are you doing posting it under this topic in this forum?  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm13.gif" alt="cwm13" border="0" /><br /><br />Either it was intentional or you have a hell of a way of writing a &quot;rave&quot;<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
