		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=744" title="View the profile of zigak">zigak</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 13<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=744"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10557#msg10557"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10557#msg10557">Re: Conviction</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #24 on:</b> August 27, 2004, 05:50:22 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">They begin to say that my guild sucks and that we will never go anywhere, and that we need I need to be with &quot;&quot;&quot;the best guild on the server&quot;&quot;&quot;&nbsp; And this hasnt been the only time ive heard of Conviction Trying to recruit from guilded players before.&nbsp; &nbsp;But answer me this, if you are the &quot;&quot;&quot;best guild on the server&quot;&quot;&quot; why do you have to recruit at all&nbsp; WTF?&nbsp; And above all, recruit from already guilded players.&nbsp; To me thats Pathetic.&nbsp; If you are soo damn good, stop trying to recruit from guilded players.&nbsp; I didnt appreciate that at all.</div><br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">K, dont see where i said anything bad about conviction, i have no problem with them.&nbsp; But uh, think and read what you want, its not my fault you percieve it as such, but it was never my intent.</div><br />See the quote up above,&nbsp; it sounds like you are addressing all of conviction.&nbsp; Basically you are calling them pathetic, and insinuating that their recruitment techniques involve bashing other guilds and poaching their playerbase.&nbsp; Well if it isn&#039;t your fault its the fault of your english teachers for not teaching you how to communicate your thoughts effectively in the english language (not talking about spelling grammar here).&nbsp; That was a direct attack on Conviction.&nbsp; Don&#039;t belittle yourself further by coming here and saying thats not what you meant when cleary it is. <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">I have many friends in Convction, i know Wan and Fae and Woven in RL, and if you need to know the name of who was sending me tells, ask them, they know, ive talked to them about it.&nbsp; Its not my right to accuse a single person as the whole of a guild. </div><br />If they were really your friends you would have given one of them heads up instead of bashing their guild on the server message board rant forum.&nbsp; Gee with friends like you in game I certaintly wouldn&#039;t need enemys. <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">bullshit accusations????&nbsp; Then how is that&nbsp; 3 of the 10 people who have posted here, have said that this happened............are we all part of some secret society built to take down Conviction??? <br />&nbsp; Again my whole point was not to fire blame or to bad mouth anyone, it was simply to state that this sort of thing is happening. <br /></div><br /><br />Yet you can&#039;t post their name here, you can post the Conviction guild name all over the place yet you are afraid to post the name of the person who tryed to recruit you?&nbsp; BULLSHIT.&nbsp; Your point is to belittle Conviction, try again.&nbsp; &nbsp;Retard 0&nbsp; Conviction 1 <br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
