								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=516"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10593#msg10593"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10593#msg10593">Re: Conviction</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #26 on:</b> August 28, 2004, 11:11:38 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Heh gotta go with bullshit also .. especially that he didnt &quot;intend&quot; to bash Conviction. Ok flaming fucking retard you post in a rant section wiht the guild name how the members tell this taht your guild sucks blah blah which it prolly does. You should be flattered fuck nut they are a Time guild in the top 4 on the server recruiting .. Guilds loose people people retire they want new blood .. for the record I have no affiliation with Conviction nor have I been recruited by them in any way. Just pisses me off to see dumb shit like this .. someone does something that should make you feel good and you get insulted.. haha.<br /><br />PS Not near enough cussing and drama in this thread trying to get it beefed up and I am bored.
						</td>
					</tr>
