	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10642"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=817" title="View the profile of Morthias">Morthias</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 2<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=817"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10642#msg10642"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10642#msg10642">Re: Conviction</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #28 on:</b> August 30, 2004, 01:27:35 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I really hate that I have to post on this subject.&nbsp; The immediate assumption is that the original poster is full of&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/bullshit.gif" alt="Bull Shit!" border="0" />.&nbsp; He has absolutely nothing to gain from this.&nbsp; <br /><br />A player from my previous guild (Axiom Shift) has sent me several tells to persuade me over to Conviction.&nbsp; This guy is a long term friend of mine so I don&#039;t have any hard feelings about it.&nbsp; Perhaps he just misses my company - perhaps Conviction is in dire need of clerics?<br /><br />Maybe you need to just ask your guild who are sending these tells.&nbsp; I would rather not post the names of these two people because they are friends of mine....
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg10661"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=579" title="View the profile of Retrievil">Retrievil</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 19<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.hegemonyguild.com/forums/images/avatars/13170030164036b29d4f23c.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Officer of Hegemony<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=Retrievil&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="Retrievil" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=579"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10661#msg10661"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1073.msg10661#msg10661">Re: Conviction</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #29 on:</b> August 31, 2004, 01:46:03 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">They begin to say that my guild sucks and that we will never go anywhere, and that we need I need to be with &quot;&quot;&quot;the best guild on the server&quot;&quot;&quot;</div><br />&nbsp;I could give 2 shits who Conviction wants to recruit to be honest, its a cut throat server nowadays, however, there is at least some truth in this.  A few nights ago my GF (Yatsumi-OA) was sitting in PoT and someone named Meoww(sp?), said something pretty similar to this.   Started off with &#039;MMMM I spy a new app&#039;, your guild wont go anywhere, and convictions the best in the middle, and ended with &#039;give me a hug&#039;.   We both just laughed, considering if she wanted to leave OA, she would be in Hegemony.&nbsp; &nbsp;To top it all off we are best friends IRL with one of Convictions top necros, who constantly tries to recruit us (jokingly).  The Meoww guy wasnt really rude or anything, but he definetly was recruiting.<br /><br />If the leadership isnt aware of it, then I&#039;d say your pretty out of touch with your people.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: August 31, 2004, 01:47:59 am by Retrievil</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><div align="center"><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=333155" target="_blank"><img src="http://members.shaw.ca/jpew/sig.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a></div>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
</table>
